  "prompt": "Cho hai lực <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mover><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover></semantics></math>, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mover><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover></semantics></math> không cùng phương, cùng tác dụng vào một vật, biết <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">|</mo><mover><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">|</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">|</mo><mover><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">|</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></semantics></math> N, và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mover><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>;</mo><mover><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>60</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></mrow></semantics></math>. Tính độ lớn của hợp lực <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover></mrow></semantics></math>.",
